### rye kernel  --RO:0001000-->  rye plant
#   evidence:   audit F11, build/detect_misparent.py
#   confidence: high
#   claim:      contains
#   query:      rye
#   reviewer:   Matt
#   FoodOn parents rye kernel under sumac food product (IDs 00003734 vs sumac
#   berry 00003733, an adjacent-ID slip). A rye query misses rye kernel and
#   its raw/cooked/dried forms - a gluten false negative.
obo:FOODON_00003734 rdfs:subClassOf [
    a owl:Restriction ;
    owl:onProperty obo:RO_0001000 ;
    owl:someValuesFrom obo:FOODON_03411313 ] .
